{"id": "2273", "title": "雷雨", "author": "曹禺", "category": "文学名著", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/2/2273.htm", "intro": "外文名称 Thunderstorm \r\n　　原作者：曹禺\r\n　　主要人物\r\n　　周朴园——某煤矿公司董事长，55岁\r\n　　周蘩漪——其妻，35岁\r\n　　周萍——其前妻生子，28岁\r\n　　周冲——蘩漪生子，17岁\r\n　　鲁侍萍——朴园妻子，某校女佣，47\r\n　　鲁贵——周宅仆人，48\r\n　　鲁四凤——鲁贵与侍萍女，18，周宅使女。\r\n　　鲁大海——朴园与侍萍之子，煤矿工人，27", "base": "files/article/html/2/2273", "chapters": [{"title": "景", "file": "233861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一幕", "file": "233932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二幕", "file": "233986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三幕", "file": "234021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四幕", "file": "234059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "尾声", "file": "234088.html", "available": false}]}